# ACLs for the authenticated LAN listener (1884). Each credential is
# confined to its own topic tree, so a compromised device or phone
# password reaches only that device's own topics.
#
# The heat-pump interface publishes state under its base topic and
# subscribes its controller/set commands; readwrite on the tree covers
# both directions.
user ivt490
topic readwrite ivt490/#

# One OwnTracks user per phone, confined to their own subtree. The
# person entity's id, "alice/phone", is the same two segments.
user alice
topic readwrite owntracks/alice/#
